# Agent skills installed by apps, not stored here (their licenses don't allow
# copying them into this public repo). `dot doctor` checks they exist;
# `dot init` reminds you to install them.
#
# name | paths that must exist | how to install
tldraw-offline | ~/.claude/skills/tldraw-offline ~/.pi/agent/skills/tldraw-offline | open tldraw offline and choose "Install Agent Skills" from its menu (after Claude Code and Pi are installed)
